"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":146,"end":158,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-4152e2315308ded664a1","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-e6db2528697a0c69ab6c","layer":"pei","quote":"河内张范，名公之子也；其志行有与原符，甚相亲敬。令曰：‘邴原名高德大，清规邈世；魁然而峙，不为孤用。闻张子颇欲学之，吾恐造之者富，随之者贫","attribution":"裴注·原别传","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":342,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-73e160afdb3d08400061","start":277,"end":346,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-41c66807f67799ed711d","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-82b5d58911d8b1be626d","layer":"original","quote":"太祖征伐，常令范及邴原留〖15〗，与世子居守〖16〗。太祖谓文帝：“举动必咨此二人〖17〗！”世子执子孙礼","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":29,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-6de3708a20fd9a0252ad","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-fd25b8b8a419e99b57fe","layer":"original","quote":"徙署丞相征事〖10〗，﹝二﹞崔琰为东曹掾，记让曰〖11〗：“征事邴原、议郎张范，皆秉德纯懿，志行忠方；清静足以厉俗〖12〗，贞固足以干事〖13〗；所谓龙翰凤翼〖14〗，国之重宝。举而用之，不仁者远","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":316,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-74f65de7be3dc2ddf886","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-82b5d58911d8b1be626d","layer":"original","quote":"建安十七年，卒","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":128,"end":135,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-75d67cf00da6604c86a8","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-0efd1a37f4da41cd753a","layer":"original","quote":"术问曰：“昔周室陵迟，则有桓、文之霸。秦失其政，汉接而用之。今孤以土地之广，士民之众；欲徼福齐桓〖7〗，拟迹高祖〖8〗。何如？”承对曰：“在德不在强！夫能用德以同天下之欲〖9〗，虽由匹夫之资，而兴霸王之功，不足为难。若苟僭拟，干时而动〖10〗；众之所弃，谁能兴之！”术不悦","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":161,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-7cf08d312c786f8bf8a1","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-ad269105414c18021e1f","layer":"original","quote":"范直诣贼，请二子。贼以陵还范。范谢曰：“诸君相还儿，厚矣〖13〗！夫人情虽爱其子；然吾怜戬之小，请以陵易之〖14〗。”贼义其言，悉以还范","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-8fac8c1410b44ba09de1","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-e6aeb1deb467ed07cee3","layer":"original","quote":"太祖平冀州，遣使迎范","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-918704e031a306f13793","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-0efd1a37f4da41cd753a","layer":"original","quote":"术复问曰：“今曹公欲以弊兵数千，敌十万之众，可谓不量力矣！子以为何如？”承乃曰：“汉德虽衰〖11〗，天命未改；今曹公挟天子以令天下，虽敌百万之众，可也。”术作色不怿〖12〗。承去之","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":172,"end":262,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-968e6e2d5dd6406ac7b1","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-0efd1a37f4da41cd753a","layer":"original","quote":"袁术备礼招请。范称疾不往，术不强屈也；遣承与相见","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-bfdb33b9ab55c06cece9","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-ad269105414c18021e1f","layer":"original","quote":"范子陵及承子戬，为山东贼所得","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-c69973b637ffde9160de","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-8dfbdb8ba5786a75295c","layer":"original","quote":"谓承曰：“今欲诛卓，众寡不敌；且起一朝之谋，战阡陌之民〖4〗；士不素抚，兵不练习：难以成功。卓阻兵而无义〖5〗，固不能久。不若择所归附，待时而动；然后可以如志","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":65,"end":144,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-ca2a7b8df9e699a38933","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-e6aeb1deb467ed07cee3","layer":"original","quote":"范以疾留彭城，遣承诣太祖","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-de4271356b4e676e470a","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-82b5d58911d8b1be626d","layer":"original","quote":"太祖自荆州还，范得见于陈；以为议郎，参丞相军事，甚见敬重","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q2-a80d6a3fc47eb1e5bf66","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-0efd1a37f4da41cd753a","layer":"original","quote":"袁术备礼招请。范称疾不往，术不强屈也；遣承与相见，术问曰：“昔周室陵迟，则有桓、文之霸。秦失其政，汉接而用之。今孤以土地之广，士民之众；欲徼福齐桓〖7〗，拟迹高祖〖8〗。何如？”承对曰：“在德不在强！夫能用德以同天下之欲〖9〗，虽由匹夫之资，而兴霸王之功，不足为难。若苟僭拟，干时而动〖10〗；众之所弃，谁能兴之！”术不悦。是时，太祖将征冀州。术复问曰：“今曹公欲以弊兵数千，敌十万之众，可谓不量力矣！子以为何如？”承乃曰：“汉德虽衰〖11〗，天命未改；今曹公挟天子以令天下，虽敌百万之众，可也。”术作色不怿〖12〗。承去之。","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":263,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
